### Best Model Selection
Based on the highly imbalanced nature of our data, the **Precision-Recall Area Under Curve (PR-AUC)** and **Recall** are the most vital metrics.
*   **Logistic Regression** generally catches more frauds (high Recall) but at the cost of many false alarms (low Precision).
*   **Random Forest** offers a much better balance. It achieves a significantly higher Precision while maintaining decent Recall, minimizing false flags while catching fraud. Thus, **Random Forest is our selected best model**.

